<section class="booking-section" id="booking"><div class="container-xl booking-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow light">Your next step</span><h2>Make time for<br /><em>your wellbeing.</em></h2><p>Choose a specialist, find a time that works, and take one small step toward feeling better.</p><div class="booking-perks"><span><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Instant confirmation</span><span><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Flexible rescheduling</span></div></div><div class="booking-panel"><div class="panel-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">Book an appointment</span><h3>Find the right care</h3></div><span class="step-count">1 <i class="bi bi-dash"></i> 3</span></div><label class="form-label" for="specialty">What kind of care do you need?</label><div class="select-wrap"><select class="form-select" id="specialty"><option>General consultation</option><option>Cardiology</option><option>Neurology</option><option>Orthopedics</option><option>Pediatrics</option></select><i class="bi bi-chevron-down"></i></div><label class="form-label mt-3" for="appointmentDate">Preferred date</label><input class="form-control" id="appointmentDate" type="date" /><div class="slot-label mt-3"><label class="form-label">Available times</label><span>Tuesday, 24 Jun</span></div><div class="slots"><button type="button" class="slot">09:00 AM</button><button type="button" class="slot active">09:30 AM</button><button type="button" class="slot">10:00 AM</button><button type="button" class="slot disabled" disabled>10:30 AM</button></div><button class="btn btn-primary w-100 mt-4" type="button" id="continueBooking">Continue to doctors <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></button><p class="demo-note"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i> This is a frontend demonstration.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="testimonial-section"><div class="container-xl testimonial-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Patient stories</span><h2>Good care leaves<br /><em>a lasting feeling.</em></h2><div class="quote-mark">&ldquo;</div></div><blockquote><p>“The entire experience felt calm and considered. I could book my appointment in minutes, and my doctor already knew my history when we met.”</p><footer><span class="avatar avatar-quote">NR</span><span><strong>Nisha Rao</strong><small>Patient since 2022</small></span></footer></blockquote></div></section>

<section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="container-xl contact-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">We are here for you</span><h2>Have a question?<br /><em>Let's talk.</em></h2><p>Our care team is ready to help with appointments, services, and anything else you need.</p><div class="contact-details"><span><i class="bi bi-telephone"></i><strong>+1 (800) 555-0198</strong></span><span><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i><strong>hello@healthcareportal.com</strong></span><span><i class="bi bi-geo-alt"></i><strong>24 Wellness Avenue, New York</strong></span></div></div><form class="contact-form demo-form"><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="contactName">Your name</label><input class="form-control" id="contactName" placeholder="Jane Smith" required /></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="contactEmail">Email address</label><input class="form-control" id="contactEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required /></div></div><label class="form-label mt-3" for="contactMessage">How can we help?</label><textarea class="form-control" id="contactMessage" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us a little about what you need..."></textarea><button class="btn btn-dark mt-3" type="submit">Send message <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right"></i></button></form></div></section>
